    "Suggest a better subtitle for %@ in its primary language with Atlas’s suggest_fields tool, read from the store page. Say in its reason that it’s a test sent from Settings. Propose nothing else." : {
      "comment" : "kind:other"
    },
    "Suggest a featuring nomination for %@ in Atlas. Read get_nominations for what's already there, get_app_versions and get_listing with fields [\"whatsNew\"] for the version being prepared, and get_in_app_events for what's coming. Pick what Apple's editors would care about most: a new app is APP_LAUNCH, a version with real new features APP_ENHANCEMENTS, an event or season NEW_CONTENT. Send one with propose_nomination: a name, a description of what people can do (no links: links go in supplementalMaterialsUris), the start date, the devices, and the linked events. Say why in one sentence with how far ahead it starts. Never submit; the person does." : {
      "comment" : "kind:other"
    },
    "Suggest a first In-App Event for %@ in Atlas. Read get_in_app_events for what's queued already, get_app_versions and get_listing with fields [\"whatsNew\"] for what's coming, and this project for something timely people can do in the app: a challenge, a new season, a live session, a major update. Send one with propose_in_app_event: a reference name, the badge, the dates (starting at least 2 days from now for App Review, lasting at most 31 days) and the texts in the primary language, with its deep link when you know it. Say why in one sentence. Never submit; the person pushes it and adds the images. %@" : {
      "comment" : "kind:other",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Suggest a first In-App Event for %1$@ in Atlas. Read get_in_app_events for what's queued already, get_app_versions and get_listing with fields [\"whatsNew\"] for what's coming, and this project for something timely people can do in the app: a challenge, a new season, a live session, a major update. Send one with propose_in_app_event: a reference name, the badge, the dates (starting at least 2 days from now for App Review, lasting at most 31 days) and the texts in the primary language, with its deep link when you know it. Say why in one sentence. Never submit; the person pushes it and adds the images. %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggest a page with propose_product_page: who it's for, its own evidence Atlas can show (those numbers, get_reviews, the approved keywords), keywords from keywords.<locale>.free that its audience searches (search results show the page's first three screenshots, not its text), promotional text in every language and the screens it leads with. Write promotional text for a page's languages with propose_product_page_texts. Don't suggest a dismissed suggestion again; send one of yours that's open again under its name to improve it. The person accepts, pushes and submits; you can't push, submit or make a page visible." : {
      "comment" : "kind:other"
    },
